o, the integral in terms of the new variable $u$ is\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{-2}\\frac{9{x}^{2}}{({x}^{3}-4)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x={\\int }_{-\\infty }^{-12}\\frac{3}{{u}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}u\n$$\n\nFinally, we proceed by setting the lower bound equal to some parameter $a,$ integrating as usual, and then taking the limit as $a\\to -\\infty .$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{-12}\\frac{3}{{u}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}u & =3{lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }{\\int }_{a}^{-12}{u}^{-2}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =3{lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }{[-{u}^{-1}]}_{a}^{-12} \\\\  & =-3\\cdot {lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }{[\\frac{1}{u}]}_{a}^{-12} \\\\  & =-3\\cdot {lim}_{a\\to -\\infty }[\\frac{1}{(-12)}-\\frac{1}{a}] \\\\  & =-3\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{12}-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534449 true] [17592186288886 1000 #edb/ref 17592186288887 13194139534449 true] [17592186288886 1000 #edb/ref 17592186288888 13194139534449 true] [17592186288886 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534449 true] [17592186288886 1041 "field-1" 13194139534449 true] [17592186288886 1104 #edb/ref 17592186288887 13194139534449 true] [17592186288886 1110 #uuid "7c3e5c2b-3a58-5ee8-8d1d-9b386e6cb07c" 13194139534449 true] [17592186288887 1034 "\\frac{1}{4}" 13194139534449 true] [17592186288887 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534449 true] [17592186288887 1111 #uuid "a78432dd-fefe-5420-a212-8cf893e9ddf4" 13194139534449 true] [17592186288888 1034 "\\frac{1}{12}" 13194139534449 true] [17592186288888 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534449 true] [17592186288888 1111 #uuid "5404ad5f-58e9-533b-9474-d96ddb48ece6" 13194139534449 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-100643" 17592186288809 "q-100643/selection" 17592186288810 "q-100643/selection/22808498a9dab5f502b3c6caf3659d3c09bea7d00272f28e595a91887b73521c" 17592186288811 "q-100643/selection/3a619fab2616dab0463f9c76cb72cd9f101e45e62111356a5b0b111e062a8dcf" 17592186288812 "q-100643/selection/7ea009d38067b85c260cd71ce15cce585e1f931f7adf440bc470127b22bd36c2" 17592186288813 "q-10064